  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\nIntransitive pair: {燻|いぶ}る (to smolder)\n\nSMOKED FOODS:\n- {燻製|くんせい} (smoked product)\n- スモークサーモン (smoked salmon)\n- {燻|いぶ}し{卵|たまご} (smoked egg)\n- {燻|いぶ}しチーズ (smoked cheese)\n\nSMOKING MATERIALS:\n- {桜|さくら}のチップ (cherry wood chips)\n- {楢|なら}のチップ (oak chips)\n- {燻|いぶ}し{液|えき} (liquid smoke)\n\nIDIOM:\n{燻|いぶ}り{出|だ}す (to smoke out, to flush out) - also used figuratively\n\nRELATED:\n- {燻製|くんせい} (smoked food)\n- {燻|いぶ}る (to smolder - intransitive)\n- {煙|けむり}{燻|いぶ}し (fumigation, smoking)",
